/*
Colonnade columns (column helper: quartz_pillar y2..4, quartz_slab bottom at y5) at z=29 (x 11,14,21,24), z=38 (x 11,14,21,24), x=11 (z 32,35) and x=24 (z 32,35). Court floor is in the shell part; add hedge (azalea_leaves at y2) on z=30 (x12..16 and x19..23), z=37 (same), x=12 and x=23 (z31..36), leaving gaps at x17..18 for the axis; smooth_stone path legs at x17..18 z27..29 and z38..40; bed helper in x13..14 z31..36 and x21..22 z31..36 (rose_bush at the corners, cornflower and poppy on the rest); fountain helper at x15..20 z31..36 (rim smooth_quartz_slab y1, water 4x4 at x16..19 z32..35, quartz_block column x17..18 z33..34 y2..3, water at (17,4,33)); statue helper at (13,33) and (22,33). Ticks E08 E09 E10 E11 E12 E13.

3. **peristyle** (module `parts/peristyle.mjs`). Columns (`column`) at the N row z=29 (x=11,14,21,24), S row z=38 (x=11,14,21,24), W column x=11 (z=32,35), E column x=24 (z=32,35). Court grass; hedges (`hedge`) on the court perimeter at z=30 (x12..16, x19..23), z=37 (same), x=12 and x=23 (z31..36); path legs (smooth_stone) at x17..18, z27..29 and z38..40; beds (`bed`) at x13..14 z31..36 and x21..22 z31..36 (the statues stand in them); `fountain` at x15..20 z31..36; `statue` at (13,33) and (22,33). Ticks: E08, E09, E10, E11, E12, E13.
*/

export function build(g) {}
